  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### Contacts - Shareholders\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 22 May, 2020 at  1:26 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:  Bookkeeping module > Dashboard > Client specific > Contacts > Shareholders\n\nClick here to watch the video\n\nThis page will show you;\n\nName of the Shareholder.\n\nShare type is Equity.\n\nNo. of shares.\n\nPhone no# and Email ID and Country is displayed.\n\nAction drop-down has an option to;\n\nMake Director,\n\nEdit,\n\nDelete\n\nYou can export as a PDF by using the “Export\\/” button on the top right of the page.\n\nOn clicking “+Shareholder”, can add new Shareholder, enter all the details. As seen in the image to the left.\n\nCheckbox for active to be selected.\n\nEnter no. of shares and value per share.\n\nSelect share type and save.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
