<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Name of the Shareholder.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Share type is Equity.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">No. of shares.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Phone no# and Email ID and Country is displayed.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Action drop-down has an option to;</span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Make Director,</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Edit,</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Delete</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9102915818/original/llMy6dqvXwmX-d1vdHlPV_ZBF8yiNDadoA.png?1590150409\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9102915818\"></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can export as a PDF by using the “Export\\/” button on the top right of the page.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">On clicking “+Shareholder”, can add new Shareholder, enter all the details. As seen in the image to the left.</span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Checkbox for active to be selected.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Enter no. of shares and value per share.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Select share type and save.</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165231\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\